    # Case 3: `A > B` / `A < B` / `A >= B` / `A <= B` (zero-FP unsigned compare + branchless `csel_x` — e.g. `tcb.priority > cur.priority ? tcb : cur`!)
    if (op == "<" || op == "<=" || op == ">" || op == ">=") && !ast_has_call?(ca)
